  "_city_placeholder": "Segments that reach JobFacets.city but name no city: a work arrangement, an internal site code, or a bare country/ISO code an ATS put in the city position. cities.py drops a segment whose folded form is one of these, or that carries a digit or a slash (Micron's \"Fab 10N/X\"). NOTE what reaches cities.py is ONE segment, not a whole location string: enrich.location_facets has already split on \",\" and \"-\" and kept the first usable piece, so \"Boise, ID - Main Site\" is stored as \"Boise\" and never needs dropping. Dropping only hides a value from the picker -- the posting stays reachable by country.",
